# Dev
.probe/
_reference/
.smoke/home*/

# Chrome profile path: the **Prelaunch Windows Chrome** run keeps the browser data
# in a Windows-native profile under LOCALAPPDATA and refreshes `<project>/.chrome`
# as a symlink **view** of it (the same path the `--user-data-dir=.chrome` the
# **Flags WSL** control names resolves to). The path is run-owned state — link
# or directory — never checkout content, so the whole entry stays ignored
# (a per-port relative `.chrome-<port>` is the same kind of local data).
.chrome
.chrome-*

